<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-ANTIC DECLINES YUGOSLAVIA COACHING JOB.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ANTIC DECLINES YUGOSLAVIA COACHING JOB.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atletico Madrid's Serbian coach Radomir Antic has rejected an offer to take charge of Yugoslavia's national team.</p>
<p>&quot;Atletico covers my aspirations,&quot; said Antic on Thursday.</p>
<p>Yugoslavian officials were reported to have made the offer to Antic in a visit to Madrid on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
